@MatthewBonanni Thanks for coordinating with the FlashInfer team and for planning the TRT-LLM workaround! That sounds good to me, and I appreciate your help moving this forward.

When you have a chance, could you also take a look at my other HiSparse fix, #64989? It releases temporary device KV bindings after graph profiling while retaining the Host pool. The PR includes the regression test and validation results, along with their scope and limitations.

Thanks again for your time and help!

